A complete state contains:

```text
scope ∈ {FS, GS, RS, US}

time ∈ {LL, MM, NN}
```

Therefore the local state lattice contains:

```text
4 × 3 = 12
```

scope-time configurations:

```text
LL.FS LL.GS LL.RS LL.US
MM.FS MM.GS MM.RS MM.US
NN.FS NN.GS NN.RS NN.US
```

With sixty sexagesimal phases:

```text
3 × 4 × 60
=
720
```

The notation address is:

```text
Temporal.Scope.Phase
```

Examples:

```text
LL.US.17
MM.GS.18
NN.FS.19
```

or directly in notation:

```text
(US . ?)
→
(GS . /O)
→
